export const SOURCE_MD: string = "# Kaptured.AI Outbound Sequences & Reply Library\n\n## Core Sales Principle\n\nKeep cold outreach short:\n\n**Signal → Outcome → Offer → CTA**\n\n### First-email business outcome\n\nLead with:\n\n**Lower production cost + better margins + less time/effort spent on shoots and content creation.**\n\nThen introduce images/videos as the mechanism, not the main pitch.\n\n\nDo not over-explain AI in the first message. Sell the outcome first.\n\nPrimary conversion path:\n\n**Cold prospect → Reply → Product → Sample → Scope → Close**\n\nFor Kaptured, the work itself is the demo.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n# Outbound Sequences\n\nUse whichever signal you know. Do not force fake personalization.\n\nThe structure stays:\n\n**Signal → Outcome → Offer → CTA**\n\n---\n\n## Option 1: You Only Know Their Name / Company\n\n### Subject Line Options\n\n- Has {{company}} shifted to AI production?\n- Is {{company}} using AI for shoots yet?\n- Has {{company}} tried AI shoots?\n- {{company}} + AI production\n- AI production for {{company}}\n- {{company}}'s next shoot\n- Replacing shoots at {{company}}\n- Still shooting everything traditionally?\n- How {{company}} produces content\n- A faster way to shoot {{company}}\n- {{company}} without another shoot\n- Cut shoot costs at {{company}}\n- {{company}} content costs\n- Reducing {{company}}'s shoot costs\n- More content, fewer shoots\n- Your next photoshoot\n- Do you still need the shoot?\n- What if you skipped the next shoot?\n\n### Message 1\n\nHey {{first_name}}, came across {{company}}.\n\nWe help brands cut shoot/content costs, improve margins and save hours of coordination by handling product images + videos end to end with AI.\n\nWorth seeing what this could look like for {{company}}?\n\n### Follow-up 1: Done for You\n\nBtw, it's fully done for you: catalogs, styling, model shoots, campaign images, reels + ad creatives.\n\nYou send the products, we handle the rest.\n\n### Follow-up 2: Credibility\n\nWe've already produced for 200+ brands, including Laa Polky Stories by Raniwala, Onya, Jack N Jill & Ethnic Cottler.\n\nBuilt by IIT Bombay + YC founders. Happy to share a few examples.\n\n### Follow-up 3: Sample\n\nRather than another pitch, happy to create one product for {{company}} so you can judge the quality yourself.\n\nWant me to pick one from your site?\n\n---\n\n## Option 2: They Are Running Ads\n\n### Subject Line Options\n\n- Saw {{company}}'s ads\n- More ad creative, fewer shoots\n- {{company}}'s creative costs\n- Scaling creative for {{company}}\n- More creatives for the same budget\n- Cut creative costs at {{company}}\n- Spending more on ads than shoots?\n- AI production for {{company}} ads\n- Faster ad creative for {{company}}\n- {{company}} without another shoot\n\n### Message 1\n\nSaw {{company}} is actively running ads.\n\nWe help brands lower creative costs, improve margins and produce more images + videos with AI, without constantly organizing new shoots.\n\nWorth trying it on one product you're advertising?\n\n### Follow-up 1: Creative Volume\n\nThe idea is simple: more creatives to test without more shoot coordination.\n\nWe handle catalogs, model shoots, campaign images, reels + ad creatives end to end.\n\n### Follow-up 2: Credibility\n\nWe've already produced for 200+ brands, including Laa Polky Stories by Raniwala, Onya, Jack N Jill & Ethnic Cottler.\n\nBuilt by IIT Bombay + YC founders.\n\n### Follow-up 3: Sample\n\nHappy to take one product you're currently advertising and create a fresh visual for it.\n\nWant me to pick one?\n\n---\n\n## Option 3: Recent News / Launch / Event\n\n### Subject Line Options\n\n- Shooting the {{collection_name}}?\n- {{collection_name}} without a shoot\n- AI production for {{collection_name}}\n- Faster content for {{collection_name}}\n- Saw the {{collection_name}} launch\n- Content for the new launch\n- How are you shooting {{collection_name}}?\n- {{company}} launch production\n- Cut shoot costs for {{collection_name}}\n- More launch content, fewer shoots\n\nExamples:\n\n- launched a new collection\n- opened a new store\n- raised funding\n- entered a new market\n- launched a campaign\n- announced a collaboration\n- launched a new category\n- seasonal collection launch\n\n### Message 1\n\nSaw you just {{news_trigger}}.\n\nWe help brands launch more profitably by cutting shoot/content costs and handling the images + videos end to end with AI, with far less time from your team.\n\nWorth trying it on one product?\n\n### Example: New Collection\n\nSaw you just launched the FW26 collection.\n\nWe could help you launch it with much lower shoot/content costs, better margins and far less coordination from your team, while handling the images + videos end to end.\n\nWorth trying it on one product?\n\n### Follow-up 1: Done for You\n\nBtw, we can handle the full creative around the launch: catalogs, styling, model shoots, campaign images, reels + ad creatives.\n\nYou send the products, we handle the rest.\n\n### Follow-up 2: Credibility\n\nWe've already produced for 200+ brands, including Laa Polky Stories by Raniwala, Onya, Jack N Jill & Ethnic Cottler.\n\nBuilt by IIT Bombay + YC founders.\n\n### Follow-up 3: Sample\n\nHappy to create one product around the launch first so you can judge the quality yourself.\n\nWant me to pick one from the site?\n\n---\n\n## Option 4: You Know What They Sell\n\n### Subject Line Options\n\n- Shooting your {{product}} with AI?\n- AI shoots for your {{product}}\n- {{product}} without a photoshoot\n- Cut {{product}} shoot costs\n- Faster {{product}} content\n- Your {{product}} shoots\n- {{product}} images + videos\n- More {{product}} content, fewer shoots\n- AI production for {{product}}\n- A faster way to shoot {{product}}\n\nExamples:\n\n- jewelry\n- rings\n- dresses\n- sarees\n- bags\n- shoes\n- kidswear\n- jackets\n- beauty products\n- watches\n\n### Message 1\n\nCame across your {{product/category}}.\n\nWe help brands cut the cost and effort of shooting products while improving margins, with images + videos made with AI, end to end.\n\nWorth trying it on one {{product}}?\n\n### Example: Jewelry\n\nCame across your jewelry collection.\n\nWe help jewelry brands cut shoot/content costs and save the coordination of models, studios and production, while handling images + videos end to end.\n\nWorth trying it on one piece?\n\n### Example: Rings\n\nCame across your rings.\n\nWe help jewelry brands improve margins by reducing shoot/content costs and the time spent coordinating production, while handling images + videos end to end.\n\nWorth trying it on one ring?\n\n### Example: Apparel\n\nCame across your collection.\n\nWe help apparel brands cut shoot/content costs, improve margins and save hours of production coordination, while handling images + videos end to end.\n\nWorth trying it on one product?\n\n### Follow-up 1: Specific Use Cases\n\nWe can handle the full creative around the products: catalog shots, styling, model shoots, lifestyle images, reels + ad creatives.\n\nYou send the products, we handle the rest.\n\n### Follow-up 2: Credibility\n\nWe've already produced for 200+ brands, including Laa Polky Stories by Raniwala, Onya, Jack N Jill & Ethnic Cottler.\n\nBuilt by IIT Bombay + YC founders.\n\n### Follow-up 3: Sample\n\nHappy to take one {{product}} from your site and create something for it first.\n\nWant me to pick one?\n\n---\n\n# Subject Line Guidance\n\nKeep subject lines short, natural and tied to a real business outcome.\n\n## Company / Production Angle\n\n- Has {{company}} shifted to AI production?\n- Is {{company}} using AI for shoots yet?\n- Has {{company}} tried AI shoots?\n- {{company}} + AI production\n- AI production for {{company}}\n- {{company}}'s next shoot\n- Replacing shoots at {{company}}\n- Still shooting everything traditionally?\n- How {{company}} produces content\n- A faster way to shoot {{company}}\n- {{company}} without another shoot\n- Cut shoot costs at {{company}}\n- {{company}} content costs\n- Reducing {{company}}'s shoot costs\n\n## Running Ads\n\n- Reduce your ad spend?\n- More ad creative, fewer shoots\n- {{company}}'s creative costs\n- Saw {{company}}'s ads\n- Scaling creative for {{company}}\n- More creatives for the same budget\n- Cut creative costs at {{company}}\n\n## Launch / News\n\n- Shooting the {{collection_name}}?\n- {{collection_name}} without a shoot\n- AI production for {{collection_name}}\n- Faster content for {{collection_name}}\n- Saw the {{collection_name}} launch\n- Content for the new launch\n- How are you shooting {{collection_name}}?\n\n## Product Known\n\n- Shooting your {{product}} with AI?\n- AI shoots for your {{product}}\n- {{product}} without a photoshoot\n- Cut {{product}} shoot costs\n- Faster {{product}} content\n- Your {{product}} shoots\n- {{product}} images + videos\n\n## Best Defaults\n\n- **Name/company only:** `Has {{company}} shifted to AI production?`\n- **Running ads:** `More ad creative, fewer shoots`\n- **Recent launch/news:** `{{collection_name}} without a shoot`\n- **Product known:** `{{product}} without a photoshoot`\n\nAvoid over-marketed subjects such as:\n\n- AI Content Solutions for Your Brand\n- Save 70% on Content Production\n- Revolutionize Your Creative Workflow\n- Quick Partnership Opportunity\n\n---\n\n# Which Opening to Use\n\n## If You Only Know Their Name\nLead with the outcome.\n\n> We could turn your products into realistic, product-accurate images + videos, delivered in days, not weeks.\n\n## If They're Running Ads\nLead with creative volume.\n\n> We could give you a constant stream of fresh images + videos without organizing another shoot.\n\n## If You Know Recent News\nTie the service directly to what just happened.\n\n> Saw you just launched FW26. We could turn the entire collection into images + videos, delivered in days, not weeks.\n\n## If You Know Their Product\nMake the outcome tangible around that exact product.\n\n> Came across your rings. We could turn each design into model shots, campaign images + videos without a physical shoot.\n\n---\n\n# Shorter Versions for High-Volume Outreach\n\n## Name Only\n\nHey {{first_name}}, came across {{company}}.\n\nWe create realistic, product-accurate images + videos, delivered in days, starting at $5/product.\n\nWorth seeing one?\n\n## Running Ads\n\nSaw {{company}} is running ads.\n\nWe can give you more fresh images + videos to test without organizing more shoots.\n\nWant me to make one?\n\n## Recent News\n\nSaw you just {{news_trigger}}.\n\nWe could turn it into fresh campaign images + videos, delivered in days.\n\nWorth seeing one?\n\n## Product Known\n\nCame across your {{product}}.\n\nWe could turn it into model shots, campaign images + videos without a physical shoot.\n\nWorth seeing one?\n\n---\n\n# Recommended 4-Email Sequence\n\nThe purpose of the sequence is not to keep repeating the same pitch.\n\nEach message should do a different job:\n\n**Email 1:** Trigger + outcome  \n**Email 2:** Explain the business value  \n**Email 3:** Add credibility  \n**Email 4:** Close the loop\n\nThe core business outcome is:\n\n> More content. Lower production cost. Less time spent coordinating shoots.\n\nAI explains how we deliver it. The business case explains why they should care.\n\n---\n\n## Email 1: Initial Outreach\n\n### Version A: Direct\n\n**Subject:** Has {{company}} shifted to AI production?\n\nHi {{first_name}},\n\nSaw {{personalized_trigger}}.\n\nWe help brands create product-accurate images + videos, delivered in days, starting at $5/product.\n\nCould be worth seeing how much {{company}} could cut shoot costs, save team time and improve margins.\n\n### Version B: Outcome Led\n\n**Subject:** {{company}} without another shoot\n\nHi {{first_name}},\n\nWhat if {{company}} could produce catalogs, campaigns, reels + ad creatives without organizing another shoot?\n\nWe do it end-to-end, delivered in days, starting at $5/product.\n\nWorth seeing the numbers?\n\n### Version C: Pain Led\n\n**Subject:** More content, fewer shoots\n\nHi {{first_name}},\n\nMost brands don't need more shoot planning. They need more content from every product.\n\nWe handle images + videos end-to-end, while reducing production cost and time spent coordinating shoots.\n\nWorth exploring for {{company}}?\n\n---\n\n## Email 2: Business Value\n\n**Subject:** Re: Has {{company}} shifted to AI production?\n\nHi {{first_name}},\n\nMain reason I reached out: this isn't just about using AI.\n\nIt's about reducing shoot costs, producing more content faster and taking the coordination work off your team.\n\nWe handle catalogs, styling, model shoots, campaign images, reels + ads end-to-end.\n\nWorth testing on one product?\n\n---\n\n## Email 3: Credibility\n\n**Subject:** Re: Has {{company}} shifted to AI production?\n\nHi {{first_name}},\n\nFor context, we've already produced for 200+ brands including Laa Polky Stories by Raniwala, Onya, Jack N Jill & Ethnic Cottler.\n\nFounded by IIT Bombay + YC alumni.\n\nHappy to create one product first so you can judge the quality and economics yourself.\n\n---\n\n## Email 4: Close the Loop\n\n**Subject:** close the loop?\n\nHi {{first_name}},\n\nI'll close the loop after this.\n\nIf reducing shoot costs, speeding up content production or giving your team back time becomes a priority, happy to help.\n\nCan always start with one product.\n\n---\n\n## Outcome-Led CTA Options\n\nUse these instead of generic lines like \"Worth seeing one?\"\n\n- Worth seeing how {{company}} could cut shoot costs, save team time and improve margins?\n- Worth seeing what this could save {{company}} per collection?\n- Worth seeing how much production time this could take off your team?\n- Worth testing whether this can replace part of your next shoot?\n- Worth seeing how many more creatives you could produce with the same budget?\n- Worth comparing this against your current shoot cost?\n- Worth seeing how this could improve margins on content production?\n- Want to see the numbers on one product first?\n\n---\n\n# Reply Library\n\n## Interested / Tell Me More\n\nGreat. We handle the full creative process: styling, model shoots,\ncatalogs, campaign images, reels + ad creatives.\n\nSend me a product link/image and I'll show you what we can do with it.\n\n## Jewelry Samples\n\nAbsolutely. Here are our jewelry examples:\n\nPhotos: https://www.kaptured.ai/jewelry-examples/\\\nVideos: https://www.kaptured.ai/video-examples/#jewelry\n\nIf you send me one of your products, I can also show you something\ncloser to your brand.\n\n## Apparel Samples\n\nAbsolutely. Here are our apparel examples:\n\nPhotos: https://www.kaptured.ai/apparel-examples/\\\nVideos: https://www.kaptured.ai/video-examples/#apparel\n\nIf you send me one product, I can also show you something closer to your\nbrand.\n\n## Send Examples\n\nAbsolutely. Are you mainly looking for images or videos?\n\nI'll send the closest examples rather than dumping the whole portfolio.\n\n## How Much?\n\nProduct shoots start at \\$5/product. Reels, ad creatives and campaign\nvideos depend on the concept and volume.\n\nSend me roughly how many products you have and what you need, and I'll\ngive you an exact price.\n\n## Is \\$5 Really the Price?\n\nYes, product shoots start at \\$5/product.\n\nFinal pricing depends on volume, number of images, styling and whether\nyou need videos/campaign work too.\n\n## What's Included in \\$5?\n\nIt depends on the shoot format and volume.\n\nSend me the number of products + what you need per product and I'll\nbreak down exactly what's included.\n\n## Why Is It So Cheap?\n\nBecause we're replacing the expensive parts of traditional production:\nstudios, models, travel and shoot logistics.\n\nThe creative direction and final QC are still handled by our team.\n\n## What Do You Need From Us?\n\nJust your product images/link + any brand references you have.\n\nWe handle concepts, styling, models, backgrounds, generation and final\nproduction.\n\n## How Does It Work?\n\nYou send product images + any references. We handle concepts, styling,\nmodels, backgrounds, images, videos and revisions.\n\nEverything is delivered ready to use.\n\n## What Kind of Product Images Do You Need?\n\nClean product images work best, but send whatever you have.\n\nWe'll check them first and tell you if anything else is needed.\n\n## Do We Need to Send Physical Products?\n\nUsually no. We work directly from your existing product images, so\nthere's no shipping or physical shoot required.\n\n## Can You Do Our Whole Collection?\n\nYes. That's actually where this works best.\n\nSend me the number of SKUs + what you need per product, and I'll map out\nturnaround and pricing for the full collection.\n\n## Can You Handle 100 / 500 Products?\n\nYes, we're built for high-volume production.\n\nSend me the SKU count + deliverables per SKU and I'll give you the\ntimeline and pricing.\n\n## Can You Deliver Every Week / Month?\n\nYes. We can work as your ongoing creative production team and deliver\nfresh images/videos every week or month.\n\nHappy to structure it around your content volume.\n\n## Can You Make a Sample?\n\nAbsolutely. Send me one product image/link + any reference you like.\n\nWe'll take it from there.\n\n## Do You Do Videos Too?\n\nYes. Product videos, reels, campaign films and ad creatives, along with\nthe images.\n\nWe can handle the entire campaign from the same product assets.\n\n## Can You Make Reels?\n\nYes. We create short-form product reels, fashion films and campaign\nvideos.\n\nSend me the style you're after and I'll share the closest examples.\n\n## Can You Make Meta Ad Creatives?\n\nYes. We create static ads, video ads and multiple creative variations\nfor testing.\n\nWe can build them around your existing products/offers.\n\n## Do You Only Do Catalog Shoots?\n\nNot at all. We do catalogs, model shoots, lifestyle images, campaigns,\nreels, product videos and ad creatives.\n\nBasically everything around the product.\n\n## Can You Do White-Background / PDP Images?\n\nYes. We can do clean PDP/catalog images as well as lifestyle and\ncampaign creatives from the same products.\n\n## Can You Create Everything for a Launch?\n\nYes. We can handle the full launch: catalog, campaign images, model\nshoots, reels + ad creatives.\n\nYou send the collection, we handle the creative production.\n\n## Is This AI?\n\nYes, it's made with AI, and fully managed by our team.\n\nYou send the products, we handle concepts, styling, models, images,\nvideos and revisions until it's ready to use.\n\n## Why Not Just Use ChatGPT / Gemini?\n\nYou absolutely can for individual generations.\n\nThe difference is we're your production team: concepts, styling,\nconsistent models, product accuracy, images, videos, retouching +\nrevisions, all handled for you.\n\n## How Are You Different From an AI Tool?\n\nThe tool gives you generations. We give you finished creative.\n\nConcepts, styling, models, product accuracy, images, videos,\nretouching + revisions are handled by our team.\n\n## Can We Run It Ourselves?\n\nYes. Most brands have us run the whole production for them.\n\nIf you'd rather run your own shoots with our studio, I can show you how\nthat works too.\n\n## We Tried AI Before and It Looked Bad\n\nThat's actually one of the main reasons brands come to us.\n\nInstead of judging AI generally, send me one product and judge our\noutput on that.\n\n## Can You Guarantee It Won't Look AI?\n\nOur goal is for it to feel like a real production, not \"AI content.\"\n\nBest way to judge is on your own product. Happy to create one first.\n\n## How Accurate Are the Products?\n\nProduct accuracy is one of our biggest focuses, especially for jewelry\nand apparel.\n\nHappy to do one of your products first so you can judge the accuracy\nyourself.\n\n## Will the Jewelry / Product Stay Exact?\n\nProduct accuracy is a core part of our workflow, especially for jewelry\nand apparel.\n\nSend me one of your more detailed products and we can test that first.\n\n## Can You Preserve Logos / Text / Details?\n\nYes, we specifically QC logos, patterns, product details and overall\naccuracy before final delivery.\n\nFor intricate products, we recommend testing one SKU first.\n\n## Our Products Are Complicated\n\nEven better to test first.\n\nSend me one of your most detailed products. If we can get that right,\nyou'll know whether it works for the rest.\n\n## What Resolution Do We Get?\n\nWe can deliver high-resolution, production-ready images, including up to\n4K depending on the project.\n\nTell me where they'll be used and we'll deliver accordingly.\n\n## Can You Match Our Brand Aesthetic?\n\nYes. Send your website, moodboard or a few references you like.\n\nWe'll build the styling and visual direction around your brand.\n\n## Can I Send Pinterest References?\n\nAbsolutely. Pinterest, campaign references, moodboards or even\ncompetitor examples all work.\n\nWe use them to understand the direction you want.\n\n## Can You Do Styling?\n\nYes. Styling is fully handled by us, including looks, pairings,\naccessories and overall creative direction.\n\n## Do We Need Models?\n\nNo. We can create the models and handle the complete shoot digitally.\n\nYou can choose the look, age, ethnicity and overall aesthetic.\n\n## Can We Use Our Existing Model?\n\nYes. If you have permission to use their likeness, send us reference\nimages and we'll check what's possible.\n\n## Can You Keep the Same Model Across the Collection?\n\nYes. We can maintain consistent models and visual direction across the\ncollection so it feels like one cohesive shoot.\n\n## We Don't Want Generic AI-Looking Models\n\nNeither do we. We define the model, styling, lighting and visual\ndirection around the brand instead of using generic AI outputs.\n\nHappy to show you examples.\n\n## Our Brand Is Very Premium\n\nThat's exactly where creative direction matters most.\n\nSend me a campaign you feel represents the brand well and we'll create\naround that standard.\n\n## Can You Work From Our Existing Shoot?\n\nYes. Existing shoot assets are actually a great starting point.\n\nWe can extend them into additional scenes, campaign creatives and videos\nwithout reshooting everything.\n\n## We Already Have a Shoot Planned\n\nMakes sense. We can complement it with extra ad variations, reels or\ncampaign creatives without needing another shoot day.\n\nCould be useful for extending the life of the shoot.\n\n## We Already Have a Photographer / Agency\n\nMakes sense. We usually complement existing teams when they need more\ncreative volume or something turned around quickly.\n\nHappy to do one product so you can keep us as a backup.\n\n## We Have an In-House Team\n\nPerfect. We can work as extra production capacity when your team needs\nmore creatives than they can produce internally.\n\nHappy to test it on one product.\n\n## We Only Need a Few Products\n\nThat's fine. We don't need to start with the full collection.\n\nSend the products you want to test and we can start small.\n\n## What If I Don't Like the Output?\n\nWe'll revise the direction until you're happy with the final output.\n\nThat's why we usually start with one product and lock the look first.\n\n## Do You Offer Revisions?\n\nYes, unlimited revisions until you're happy with the final output.\n\n## How Quickly?\n\nProduct shoots are delivered in days, not weeks.\n\nFor larger catalogs/collections, send me the SKU count and I'll give you\nan exact timeline.\n\n## How Soon Can You Start?\n\nWe can start immediately.\n\nSend me the products + required deliverables and I'll confirm timeline\nand pricing today.\n\n## Who Have You Worked With?\n\nWe've produced for 200+ brands, including Laa Polky Stories by Raniwala, Onya,\nJack N Jill & Ethnic Cottler.\n\nHappy to send the most relevant work based on what you're looking to\ncreate.\n\n## Who Are You Guys?\n\nWe're an AI production studio working with brands globally, founded by\nIIT Bombay + YC alumni (Naman Kasliwal, CEO, and Aarushi Jain, COO).\n\nWe handle the entire creative production process, not just AI\ngeneration.\n\n## Where Are You Based?\n\nWe work with brands globally, including US/UK time zones.\n\nEverything from briefing to final delivery is handled remotely.\n\n## Can We Do a Demo / Talk?\n\nAbsolutely. Grab any slot that works for you:\n\nhttps://calendly.com/aarushi-kaptured/20min?utm_source=email&utm_content=reply-library\n\n## Can I Call or WhatsApp?\n\nSure.\n\nWhatsApp / call: +91 99839 16095\n\n## Send Your Deck\n\nSure, I'll send it over.\n\nQuickly, are you mainly looking for catalog/product images, campaign\ncreatives or videos? I'll send the most relevant work too.\n\n## Send Your Portfolio\n\nAbsolutely. Are you mainly looking for apparel/jewelry and\nimages/videos?\n\nI'll send the closest examples rather than dumping the whole portfolio.\n\n## Email Me\n\nSure. What's the best email?\n\nI'll send the relevant examples + a quick overview there.\n\n## Send This to My Marketing / Creative Person\n\nAbsolutely. Feel free to connect us here or share their email and I'll\nsend them the relevant examples + details.\n\n## I'll Discuss With My Team\n\nOf course. Happy to make one sample you can show the team too.\n\nThat usually makes it much easier to evaluate.\n\n## Not Right Now\n\nTotally. When's your next collection/campaign going live?\n\nHappy to reconnect closer to it.\n\n## Let's Reconnect Next Month\n\nAbsolutely. I'll reconnect next month.\n\nIf you have a collection or campaign launching around then, send me the\ntiming and I'll reach out closer to it.\n\n## We're Launching in November\n\nPerfect. Ideally we'd lock the creative direction before the launch\nrush.\n\nWhen do you need the final assets ready?\n\n## Not Interested\n\nNo worries, thanks for letting me know.\n\nIf you ever need extra creative capacity for a launch or campaign, happy\nto help.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n# Payment, Rights & Confidentiality\n\n## Do You Charge Upfront?\n\nFor projects, we typically take payment upfront once the scope and\nsample direction are approved.\n\nHappy to first show you the quality on one product.\n\n## How Do We Pay?\n\nWe accept international payments via Stripe or Wise in USD.\n\nOnce the scope is confirmed, we'll send the payment link/invoice.\n\n## Can We Use These Commercially?\n\nYes, final approved deliverables are intended for your brand's\ncommercial use across your agreed channels.\n\n*Ensure the contract terms match this statement.*\n\n## Will You Post Our Work Publicly?\n\nNot without permission. If a project needs to stay private or unreleased\nuntil launch, that's completely fine.\n\n*Ensure internal policy and contracts match this statement.*\n\n## Can You Sign an NDA?\n\nYes, happy to sign an NDA for unreleased collections or confidential\ncampaigns.\n\n## We Can't Share Unreleased Products\n\nUnderstood. We can work under NDA and keep unreleased products/campaigns\nconfidential.\n\nHappy to start with an existing product first if that's easier.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n# Closing / Next Steps\n\n## What Are the Next Steps?\n\nSimple:\n\nSend products + references → we lock the direction → produce → you\nreview → we revise → final delivery.\n\nSend me the products and we can get started.\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n# Reply Handling Framework\n\nDo not memorize every response independently. Classify replies into five\nbuckets:\n\n### 1. Curious\n\nSend relevant proof and ask for a product.\n\n### 2. Quality Objection\n\nOffer a sample using their own product.\n\n### 3. Price Objection\n\nExplain scope/value briefly and ask for volume.\n\n### 4. Operational Question\n\nAnswer briefly, then move toward product/scope.\n\n### 5. Buying Signal\n\nStop pitching. Move directly to requirements, timeline and payment.\n\n## Rule\n\n**Replies should get shorter as buying intent gets higher.**\n\nIf someone asks:\n\n> How soon can you start?\n\nDo not send another sales pitch.\n\nAnswer:\n\n> Immediately. Send me the products.\n";
